      "english": "Ben’s Diary — Buying a Watch"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "昨天我在学校旁边的商店买了一个手表，200元，我很喜欢。",
      "traditional": "昨天我在學校旁邊的商店買了一個手錶，200元，我很喜歡。",
      "pinyin": "zuó tiān wǒ zài xué xiào páng biān de shāng diàn mǎi le yí ge shǒu biǎo liǎng bǎi yuán wǒ hěn xǐ huan",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "今天丽丽看到了我的手表，她说我的手表很漂亮，我太高兴了。",
      "traditional": "今天麗麗看到了我的手錶，她說我的手錶很漂亮，我太高興了。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān lì lì kàn dào le wǒ de shǒu biǎo tā shuō wǒ de shǒu biǎo hěn piào liang wǒ tài gāo xìng le",
      "english": "Yesterday I bought a watch at the store next to the school for 200 yuan. I really like it."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Today Lili saw my watch and said that it was beautiful. I’m really happy."
    }
  ],
